{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cdy7EHPC6o8UZb5EuHwBc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Provenance\n\nOn 2026-07-19, the `deploy-staging` job restored a stale cached artifact because the cache key was based only on branch name and did not include the lockfile hash; when the lockfile changed, the key remained unchanged, causing the job to serve last week's build (Source 2, 14:02–14:07). The incident was bisected to the cache step, and the fix was confirmed by adding the lockfile hash to the cache key (Source 2, 14:31). Approximately 40 minutes of troubleshooting time was lost, and this represented the first observed instance of this failure mode (Source 2, 14:44).\n\n---\n\n**Grounding:**\n- \"stale cached artifact,\" \"cache key based only on branch name,\" \"lockfile changed but key didn't,\" \"last week's build\" → Source 2, timestamps 14:02–14:07\n- \"bisected to the cache step,\" \"lockfile hash to the cache key\" → Source 2, 14:31\n- \"~40 minutes lost,\" \"first time seen\" → Source 2, 14:44\n\n(Session-memory summary rejected; all details sourced directly from transcript.)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":497,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":275,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
